
1. One-shot Minter with Bulk Mint Support
2. FT Minter
3. Vault

VaultDatum
- NFT
- FT Policy Id
- FT Asset Name
- Fractions
- Original fractionalization seed UTxO (required to reconstruct the parameterized FT policy for Combine)

Fractionalize Transaction
- Deposit NFT token
- Mint FT token

Combine Transaction
- Locate the vault by the fraction policy/name
- Burn the exact vault fraction supply
- Spend the vault with `Withdraw`
- Get the original NFT token back

Known Exploits
User can mint more FT tokens and deposit only a fraction of it to the vault.
We need to enforce the minting of the FT tokens to be deposited to the vault and the datum must have the exact no. of fractions